---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Start here — Down Together"
  description="A quick guide to find what you need based on your situation: recent diagnosis, your child's stage, or research."
>
  <h1>Start here</h1>
  <p>
    You don't need to read the whole site at once. Pick the situation that
    matches yours:
  </p>

  <div class="card card-pillar">
    <h3>🆕 I just received the diagnosis</h3>
    <p>
      If you're in shock or feeling overwhelmed, start with the essentials:
      what to expect in the first days, who to contact, and concrete first
      steps.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/en/#basico">Go to "The basics" →</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-pillar">
    <h3>👶🧒🧑 I want content based on my child's age</h3>
    <p>
      Every article has a stage tag (early childhood, childhood, adolescence,
      adulthood) — look for it on each card to find what applies to your
      current moment, whether it's health, education, or the transition to
      adulthood.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/en/#basico">See all content →</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-pillar">
    <h3>🔬 I already know the basics, I want research and news</h3>
    <p>
      News, recent studies, and developments — with context on how
      applicable each finding is today.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/en/#avanzado">Go to "News & research" →</a></p>
  </div>

  <p>
    Want to know how this content is generated and reviewed?
    <a href="/en/about/">Read about the project</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
